    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Dive into a unique adventure on the trail of the Etherians, a vanished civilization whose technologies seem to attract many people with dubious intentions... Get your hands on these technologies before they use them to wreak havoc across the galaxy.<br><br>In this first-person exploration and survival game, many challenges await you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore planets</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/ea1c816cdb66ff33353baa4e13252950.webp?t=1708966130\" /></span><br>Your quest will take you to many different planets and environments to unlock the secrets of Etherian technology. Explore ancient caves, enter a working industrial complex and experience unique adventures!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/0e806c0f626f443874bcd66ad5702913.avif?t=1708966130\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect resources</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/ea1c816cdb66ff33353baa4e13252950.webp?t=1708966130\" /></span><br>Collect resources on your expeditions and automate their processing with various machines that you unlock as you progress. But be careful: make sure your base has enough energy to run them all!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/921c8d787ff99c1308bebb0d5997246f.avif?t=1708966130\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your base</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/ea1c816cdb66ff33353baa4e13252950.webp?t=1708966130\" /></span><br>Build your own base to make yourself at home, and develop new technologies to improve your equipment for further exploration.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/d7fce74abec10ec47d4a206037cddf9c.poster.avif?t=1708966130\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/d7fce74abec10ec47d4a206037cddf9c.webm?t=1708966130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/d7fce74abec10ec47d4a206037cddf9c.mp4?t=1708966130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Many dangers await you</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/ea1c816cdb66ff33353baa4e13252950.webp?t=1708966130\" /></span><br>During your expeditions, you're likely to encounter unexpected and hostile encounters: toxic gases, wild creatures, bounty hunters and security services; you'll have to build your own weapons to defeat them and advance your quest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/514021a2c675d362927830410d7ddde3.avif?t=1708966130\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Dive into a unique adventure on the trail of the Etherians, a vanished civilization whose technologies seem to attract many people with dubious intentions... Get your hands on these technologies before they use them to wreak havoc across the galaxy.<br><br>In this first-person exploration and survival game, many challenges await you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore planets</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/ea1c816cdb66ff33353baa4e13252950.webp?t=1708966130\" /></span><br>Your quest will take you to many different planets and environments to unlock the secrets of Etherian technology. Explore ancient caves, enter a working industrial complex and experience unique adventures!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/0e806c0f626f443874bcd66ad5702913.avif?t=1708966130\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect resources</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/ea1c816cdb66ff33353baa4e13252950.webp?t=1708966130\" /></span><br>Collect resources on your expeditions and automate their processing with various machines that you unlock as you progress. But be careful: make sure your base has enough energy to run them all!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/921c8d787ff99c1308bebb0d5997246f.avif?t=1708966130\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your base</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/ea1c816cdb66ff33353baa4e13252950.webp?t=1708966130\" /></span><br>Build your own base to make yourself at home, and develop new technologies to improve your equipment for further exploration.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/d7fce74abec10ec47d4a206037cddf9c.poster.avif?t=1708966130\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/d7fce74abec10ec47d4a206037cddf9c.webm?t=1708966130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/d7fce74abec10ec47d4a206037cddf9c.mp4?t=1708966130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Many dangers await you</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/ea1c816cdb66ff33353baa4e13252950.webp?t=1708966130\" /></span><br>During your expeditions, you're likely to encounter unexpected and hostile encounters: toxic gases, wild creatures, bounty hunters and security services; you'll have to build your own weapons to defeat them and advance your quest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406690/extras/514021a2c675d362927830410d7ddde3.avif?t=1708966130\" /></span>",
